   <chapter title="Overview">
       <p><b>File:</b> <code>OtherTests/SupportTests/Specific_Rules_Executions_test.cy.ts</code></p>
        <p><b>Folder:</b> <code>OtherTests/SupportTests</code></p>
        <p><b>Description:</b> Validates that specific rules (Rule 55 and Rule 11) can be executed successfully through the administration panel.</p>
        <p><b>Priority:</b> High</p>
        <p><b>Owner:</b> QA Team</p>
        <p><b>Tags:</b> rules, regression, admin</p>
        <p><b>Dependencies:</b> cypress</p>
    </chapter>

    <chapter title="Test Suites">
        <chapter title="Specific Rules Execution">
        </chapter>
    </chapter>

    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Checks if Rule 55 execution is executed successfully" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Execute Rule 55</p>
            <p>Navigates to the rules administration page, activates Rule 55, and executes a test run.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> High</p>
            <step>Visit `/administration/rules` → Search for Rule 55 → Activate the rule → Save → Test execution with result limit.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Rule 55 executes successfully and confirmation message is displayed.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
        <procedure title="Checks if Rule 11 execution is executed successfully" id="test-2">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Execute Rule 55</p>
            <p>Navigates to the rules administration page, activates Rule 55, and executes a test run.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> High</p>
            <step>Visit `/administration/rules` → Search for Rule 55 → Activate the rule → Save → Test execution with result limit.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Rule 55 executes successfully and confirmation message is displayed.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
    </chapter>

    <chapter title="Execution">
       <chapter title="Run Individual Test">
           <code-block lang="bash">
               npx cypress run --spec "OtherTests/SupportTests/Specific_Rules_Executions_test.cy.ts"
           </code-block>
       </chapter>
      
       <chapter title="Run in Interactive Mode">
           <code-block lang="bash">
